# S34-T02: a confirmation read and answered. Replace the page, the code and the captions with those of your site.
use Supervisor
open UsrOrderPage for UsrOrderRecord
set UsrName "changed"
click BackButton no-answer
check dialog count eq 1
check dialog contains "unsaved changes"
remember dialog as $text
answer "Cancel"
check dialog not shown
check-value UsrName eq "changed"
